      "created_at": "2019-07-09T10:59:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>First question: Yes, you trigger the effects in order. So you can push the Explorer, then add the Wilds.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Second question: A Sacred Site is 2 or more Presence, and you only trigger the rule when creating a Sacred Site. So adding a third Presence in a land does not trigger the rule, as you say. And it has to be 2 of your Presence, you can't combine with another Spirit's Presence.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:17.463Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
