      "raw": "<p>First question: Yes, you trigger the effects in order. So you can push the Explorer, then add the Wilds.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Second question: A Sacred Site is 2 or more Presence, and you only trigger the rule when creating a Sacred Site. So adding a third Presence in a land does not trigger the rule, as you say. And it has to be 2 of your Presence, you can't combine with another Spirit's Presence.</p>",
